Final checks are complete: 38 distinct CPU and capability tests pass, as do clippy and scoped formatting. Tests also confirm automatic RGB CA and vignette correction produce real changes and retain scalar parity. Four GPU execution tests fail at adapter creation; the 24MP benchmark remains ignored. I’m recording those results and limitations in the report.

